sed the syntax error. It is a different strategy from all previous attempts, which focused on let or explicit atom naming.\n\n[LESSON]:\nIn Alloy 6, to introduce several distinct atoms as variables, use quantifiers (some disj ...) rather than attempting multi-variable let-bindings, which are not supported.\n```",
